I was wondering, what would be the fastest ascension (by turn count)
achieved without taking advantage of any bones files? Any suggestions?
If there was a ttyrec available of such a game, even better!

I watched the 2318-turn ascension by Maud available at
<http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Speed_ascension>. Several bones files
were encountered, some with a wand of wishing and dragon scale mail. I
stopped watching the 2185-turn ascension by nht when a completely
dug-out pudding-farmed bones level was encountered.

I'm not saying that ascending so fast even with bones isn't an
impressive feat. But what kind of turn counts are achievable without
bones?

